OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes approved at
OL,4,ABattersea Power Station
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 203 council homes at
OL,7,FBattersea Power Station have been
OL,8,Fapproved as part of the site's #9bn
OL,9,Fregeneration.
OL,11,FWandsworth Council has agreed proposals
OL,12,Fto build the homes on an undeveloped
OL,13,Fplot on the 42-acre site, working with
OL,14,FBattersea Power Station Development
OL,15,FCompany (BPSDC).
OL,17,FThey will be offered to people on the
OL,18,Fcouncil's waiting list, with the
OL,19,Fcouncil holding a long lease on the
OL,20,Fland, owned by freeholder BPSDC.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
